    "title": "🚧 SE Far Pointe Drive closed Sept 29, 8:00-5:30",
    "text": "1 days ago 🚧 SE Far Pointe Drive closed Sept 29 for drain work\nSE Far Pointe Drive in DeSoto County, FL will be closed on Tuesday, September 29, 2026, from 8:00 AM to 5:30 PM for a cross-drain replacement .\nDuring this time, the road will be impassable .\nIf you live in this area and need to leave while work is going on:\nPark your vehicle outside the work zone before 8:00 AM Work crews will be on site and can help residents move through the work area if needed For more details, contact Road and Bridge at (863) 993-4821 .\nMore Info: Road Closure Notice • DeSoto County. FL\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
    "summary": "1 days ago 🚧 SE Far Pointe Drive closed Sept 29 for drain work SE Far Pointe Drive in DeSoto County, FL will be closed on Tuesday, September 29, 2026, from 8:00 AM to 5:30 PM for a cross-drain replacement . During this time, the road will be impassable .",
